        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-18T06:16:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>the Matriarch. A rook is a type of bird, and a building is the name for a group of them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, it is.  But that’s only one possible reading.  I merely offered another.</p>",
